    "zh": "黄绿色带屏控无人机，配光流定高、双摄、三面避障和100 m遥控距离。",
    "en": "A yellow-and-green screen-controller drone with dual cameras, optical flow, three-side obstacle sensing and a stated 100 m control range."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "黄绿色带屏控无人机，配光流定高、双摄、三面避障和100 m遥控距离。",
      "资料列有高度保持、光流定位、六轴陀螺仪和三面避障。",
      "机身电池为3.7 V、1800 mAh，遥控器内置3.7 V、1200 mAh电池；充电约50分钟，遥控距离约100 m。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "A yellow-and-green screen-controller drone with dual cameras, optical flow, three-side obstacle sensing and a stated 100 m control range.",
      "The source lists altitude hold, optical-flow positioning, a six-axis gyroscope and three-side obstacle sensing.",
      "The drone battery is listed as 3.7 V, 1,800 mAh and the controller has a built-in 3.7 V, 1,200 mAh battery."
    ]
  },
